WEBVTT

00:00.350 --> 00:02.900
Pantry. Say it, and it's ordered.

00:03.500 --> 00:08.400
Cooking, and out of bread and eggs? Just send a voice note. Pantry knows the brands you buy.

00:08.750 --> 00:12.500
At work? Type it the way you talk, and send it to the office.

00:12.750 --> 00:16.400
Changed your mind? Just say so.

00:16.650 --> 00:20.600
The whole family adds to one basket, within your limit.

00:20.800 --> 00:24.600
Running low? Pantry remembers your usual.

00:24.800 --> 00:27.600
Every bill checked. Never a card.

00:27.850 --> 00:30.000
Pantry. One voice note away.
